Backport CUDA VMM synchronization support to AWS libfabric 2.4.0amzn5.0:
https://github.com/ofiwg/libfabric/commit/2c7d11a50a3db03d26ad8260f8141621eee495f7
https://github.com/ofiwg/libfabric/commit/790f0fb944f4cbeeb4381c99db6ba827ce5ded27

The EFA MR device field is peer.device in this release. Keep the optional CUDA
symbol handling and preserve existing primary-context flags. Remove this
backport when the bundled AWS release includes both upstream fixes.

